<title>USA: Ultratech Q4 net edges up, but sales slip.</title>
<headline>Ultratech Q4 net edges up, but sales slip.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultratech Stepper Inc said Thursday its fourth quarter 1996 net income edged higher than the same period the prior year although net sales for the recent quarter dipped about 10 percent lower than 1995.</p>
<p>But net income for the 1996 year jumped 45.7 percent on net sales about 23 percent higher than 1995, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;Although I believe we may be at or near the low point in this cycle, many challenges still lie ahead,&quot; cautioned Arthur Zafiropoulo, chairman and chief executive officer of Ultratech.</p>
</text>
